<BaseLayout
  title="China Transport Guide: Trains, Airports & Apps | ChinaStyle" description="Complete transport guide for a traditional clothing trip: airport transfers for Beijing, Shanghai, Xi'an; high-speed train routes, booking on trip.com, Didi step-by-step, metro systems, and luggage tips."
